Comment: 50,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.02,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{Episódio}
Comment: 50,0:22:05.01,0:22:05.05,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{Encerramento}
Comment: 50,0:23:35.02,0:23:35.06,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{Prévia}
Dialogue: 50,0:00:31.10,0:00:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Saki-chan!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:32.36,0:00:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Que bom que veio!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:34.54,0:00:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Tá ensopada! Tudo bem?!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:36.77,0:00:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Faltou à escola e não respondeu às mensagens!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:41.99,0:00:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Vim porque tenho algo a dizer hoje.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:46.58,0:00:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu gostaria de deixar a CRYCHIC.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:49.90,0:00:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hã?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:56.15,0:00:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,E-Espere!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:58.15,0:00:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Não prefere se sentar primeiro?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:01.51,0:01:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Por quê? Aconteceu alguma coisa?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:04.06,0:01:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,É algo que não pode nos contar?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:05.86,0:01:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Ou é por nossa causa?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:09.68,0:01:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Se estiver insatisfeita com algo, eu posso refazer.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:12.05,0:01:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,É um problema pessoal.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:15.88,0:01:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Por quê?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:17.32,0:01:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Não se divertiu no último show?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:19.91,0:01:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Estava dizendo que queria fazer outro, não?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:21.94,0:01:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Nunca disse isso.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:23.31,0:01:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Não... disse?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:27.29,0:01:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas foi você quem começou a CRYCHIC.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:30.73,0:01:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Se sair...
Dialogue: 50,0:01:36.19,0:01:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Vai mesmo... parar?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:40.28,0:01:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,A Tomori está fazendo uma pergunta.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:41.96,0:01:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,E não tá sendo irresponsável?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:45.64,0:01:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que não diz nada?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:46.80,0:01:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Taki-chan, pare.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:47.80,0:01:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Então poderia parar de causar problemas? Passamos o dia todo te esperando!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:51.11,0:01:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Taki-chan.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:53.80,0:01:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Podem continuar sem mim, não podem?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:55.88,0:01:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Quê?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:56.80,0:01:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Se querem ensaiar, é só ensaiar.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:59.25,0:02:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Não tem nenhuma regra dizendo que todas precisam estar reunidas.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:02.89,0:02:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Não jogue a culpa nos outros.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:04.69,0:02:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas sem você...
Dialogue: 50,0:02:07.57,0:02:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Poderia não falar igual uma criança mimada?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:09.79,0:02:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Você é quem mais precisa praticar.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:12.26,0:02:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,O que esteve fazendo esse tempo todo?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:15.57,0:02:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela estava esperando por você!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:18.08,0:02:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Espera! Vamos conversar direito.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:20.90,0:02:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Pode ser?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:21.66,0:02:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Afinal, sempre foi uma diversão.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:24.23,0:02:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Não concorda, Mutsumi-chan?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:29.78,0:02:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu...
Dialogue: 50,0:02:32.36,0:02:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu nunca...
Dialogue: 50,0:02:33.83,0:02:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,pensei na banda...
Dialogue: 50,0:02:36.58,0:02:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,como algo divertido.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:38.63,0:02:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hã?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:13.92,0:03:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oops! Sorry.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:23.32,0:03:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Vou embora.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:27.12,0:03:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Você foi presidente do conselho estudantil no fundamental, certo? {type para consistência}
Dialogue: 50,0:03:30.11,0:03:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:30.94,0:03:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,E também pretendo ser proativa nesta escola
Dialogue: 50,0:03:33.58,0:03:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,para vivenciar uma vida escolar enriquecedora.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:36.74,0:03:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Claro, ótimo. Muito obrigada.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:40.24,0:03:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso conclui a entrevista.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:41.93,0:03:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Claro. Muito obrigada.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:47.15,0:03:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Acho que me saí bem.{Oh, that really felt worthwhile.手応えあったなぁ}
Dialogue: 52,0:03:49.48,0:03:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Meu histórico escolar é bom, então não deve dar problema.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:54.08,0:03:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}É aqui que vou recomeçar.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:07.91,0:04:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Deixou cair alguma coisa?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:23.09,0:04:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Então, já estamos quase na {\i1}Golden Week{\i0}, mas teremos uma nova aluna a partir de hoje.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:27.90,0:04:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Meu nome é Chihaya Anon!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:29.46,0:04:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Estou me transferindo numa época incomum por motivos familiares,
Dialogue: 50,0:04:32.05,0:04:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,mas espero que possamos nos dar bem.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:33.71,0:04:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Será um prazer!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:36.43,0:04:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Chihaya-san, sente-se na última fileira.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:39.83,0:04:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Prazer em conhecê-la.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:39.45,0:04:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Claro.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:42.39,0:04:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Prazer.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:43.47,0:04:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Igualmente.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:44.51,0:04:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, pedras.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:48.44,0:04:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Prazer em conhecê-la.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:49.88,0:04:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Pois bem, vamos começar a aula.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:53.66,0:04:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Minha apresentação correu sem problemas,
Dialogue: 50,0:04:55.97,0:04:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}mas será que basta para me enturmar?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:58.66,0:05:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Agora...
Dialogue: 50,0:05:01.24,0:05:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Chihaya-san?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:02.96,0:05:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hum? Que foi?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:04.80,0:05:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Takamatsu Tomori. Prazer.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:10.98,0:05:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Claro...
Dialogue: 50,0:05:18.91,0:05:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Já é hora do almoço.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:22.14,0:05:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Com quem eu deveria me enturmar?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:26.16,0:05:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Muito energéticas.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:29.36,0:05:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sérias demais.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:31.19,0:05:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomori-chan, indo para o clube de astronomia de novo?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:33.66,0:05:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:34.32,0:05:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Divirta-se.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:36.08,0:05:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Parecem fáceis de conversar.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:42.20,0:05:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Ei, posso comer com vocês?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:45.44,0:05:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Senta aí!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:46.74,0:05:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Obrigada.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:47.70,0:05:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Seu sobrenome é Chihaya...
Dialogue: 50,0:05:49.40,0:05:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Parece até nome. Que fofo.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:51.05,0:05:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Fofo?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:51.99,0:05:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,É, sim.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:53.09,0:05:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Como te chamavam na outra escola?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:55.46,0:05:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 50,0:05:57.21,0:05:58.44,Flashback,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&\t(0,230,1,\3c&H323232&\4c&H323232&)}Incrível, Chihaya!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:58.44,0:06:00.11,Flashback,,0,0,0,,Gabaritou de novo!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:59.63,0:06:00.22,Default - Alt,,0,0,0,,Chihaya!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:00.11,0:06:02.05,Flashback,,0,0,0,,Você é tão esperta, Chihaya.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:02.05,0:06:03.68,Flashback,,0,0,0,,Essa é a nossa Chihaya!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:03.68,0:06:05.89,Flashback,,0,0,0,,{\t(1894,0,1,\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}Quê? Não é pra tanto...
Dialogue: 50,0:06:07.93,0:06:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Pode me chamar de Anon.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:09.15,0:06:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Então, Anon-chan!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:10.19,0:06:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Anon também é fofo!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:11.93,0:06:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Disse que se transferiu agora por questões familiares, né?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:15.00,0:06:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Deve ser difícil.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:16.07,0:06:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, é. É complicado!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:18.24,0:06:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Todas já têm seus grupinhos formados.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:20.36,0:06:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Verdade...
Dialogue: 50,0:06:21.84,0:06:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Já conhecia a Tomori-chan?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:24.10,0:06:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hã?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:24.38,0:06:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Também pensei!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:25.90,0:06:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Falou com ela hoje cedo, não?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:27.55,0:06:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Nada disso.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:28.57,0:06:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu só a vi quando ela estava juntando... pedras?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:31.75,0:06:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, ela fica juntando de vez em quando.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:34.67,0:06:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,A cabeça-de-vento da Haneoka!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:36.58,0:06:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela parece um filhotinho.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:38.14,0:06:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hã? Já acabaram de falar sobre mim?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:38.14,0:06:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Parece um esquilo!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:39.24,0:06:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Igualzinho! É adorável!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:42.48,0:06:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Que fofa!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:55.80,0:06:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos voltar juntas?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:58.23,0:06:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Claro, vamos juntas!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:59.65,0:07:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Vocês tocam em uma banda?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:01.15,0:07:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:01.87,0:07:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Apesar que acabamos de começar...
Dialogue: 50,0:07:04.15,0:07:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Né?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:05.40,0:07:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,É?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:06.99,0:07:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Espera, todas estão?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:09.28,0:07:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Acho que muitas aqui tocam.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:11.20,0:07:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,É porque as veteranas têm uma banda incrível!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:13.28,0:07:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Tem uma banda no terceiro ano chamada Afterglow.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:16.01,0:07:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,A presidente do conselho estudantil faz parte dela.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:18.04,0:07:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Mesmo?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:19.19,0:07:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,A Pastel{\fnArial Unicode MS}✽{\fnGandhi Sans}Palettes já se formou,
Dialogue: 50,0:07:21.18,0:07:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,mas no segundo ano tem a Ako-chan senpai\N da Roselia e a LOCK-senpai da RAS.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:25.31,0:07:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Todas tocam em bandas mesmo.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:27.80,0:07:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Eu também quero fazer um show incrível o quanto antes.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:28.20,0:07:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Tchau, Tomori.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:30.37,0:07:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Né?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:31.47,0:07:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Antes precisa aprender a tocar direito.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:33.81,0:07:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}É complicado tocar enquanto canta.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:36.52,0:07:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Tem que ensaiar mais!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:36.52,0:07:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Acho que a Tomori-chan não toca em nenhuma banda.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:38.95,0:07:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,E você, Anon-chan?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:39.92,0:07:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hã?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:41.59,0:07:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu toco um pouco...
Dialogue: 50,0:07:42.87,0:07:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,É mesmo?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:43.90,0:07:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Que instrumento?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:45.51,0:07:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Meio que guitarra e vocal.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:48.07,0:07:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Nossa! Eu também!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:50.04,0:07:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Não quer se juntar a nós?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:52.33,0:07:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hã?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:53.07,0:07:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Queremos tocar uma música da Afterglow,
Dialogue: 50,0:07:55.45,0:07:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,mas precisamos de mais uma guitarrista.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:57.19,0:07:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso aí!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:57.96,0:07:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Guitarrista?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:59.33,0:08:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ou seja...
Dialogue: 50,0:08:02.11,0:08:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ficaria escondida no canto.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:05.40,0:08:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Obrigada! Vou pensar com carinho!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:09.13,0:08:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheguei!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:21.32,0:08:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Que cansaço.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:23.04,0:08:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Meus músculos faciais estão mortos.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:25.74,0:08:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas fiz amigas.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:27.63,0:08:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Até que não foi tão ruim para um primeiro dia.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:47.95,0:08:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Que bom que trouxe a guitarra.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:50.47,0:08:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Afinal, todas estão em uma banda.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:52.71,0:08:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Também preciso encontrar uma.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:01.19,0:09:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ué?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:02.85,0:09:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Ué?!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:05.16,0:09:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Desculpa!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:06.36,0:09:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu adoraria participar da banda,\N mas ainda não conheço a Afterglow...
Dialogue: 50,0:09:11.49,0:09:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Quê?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:12.50,0:09:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Não precisa se preocupar com isso.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:13.56,0:09:14.53,Default - Alt,,0,0,0,,Pois é!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:14.40,0:09:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Não, sério. Eu agradeço o convite, mas...
Dialogue: 50,0:09:18.73,0:09:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Se for para ser, prefiro cantar e tocar.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:21.48,0:09:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Aí ainda vai precisar de...
Dialogue: 50,0:09:24.50,0:09:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Espera, não tem clube de música popular?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:26.24,0:09:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Conhece essa música?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:27.36,0:09:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Conheço! Conheço!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:28.35,0:09:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Toca em tudo que é canto.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:30.28,0:09:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}É mesmo.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:27.45,0:09:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Será que dou uma chance para a orquestra?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:21.29,0:10:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Você é muito boa.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:22.64,0:10:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Faz parte da orquestra?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:24.33,0:10:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Não, não. Só entrei para ouvir.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:27.86,0:10:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Ei, não quer formar uma banda comigo?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:31.90,0:10:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, desculpe por chegar assim do nada.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:33.93,0:10:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Então, estou na turma 1-A. Meu nome é Chihaya. {1º ano, turma A}
Dialogue: 50,0:10:37.16,0:10:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Chihaya-san?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:38.53,0:10:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, pode me chamar de Anon.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:40.18,0:10:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Estou procurando membros para formar uma banda.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:42.14,0:10:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu toco guitarra e canto,\N então poderia ser a tecladista...
Dialogue: 50,0:10:44.84,0:10:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Não.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:45.39,0:10:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, já tem uma banda?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:49.48,0:10:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Não.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:55.69,0:10:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Já está quase na hora das atividades da orquestra.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:58.47,0:11:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,É melhor que também se retire.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:05.83,0:11:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,“Se retire”?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:08.74,0:11:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Não deu em nada.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:11.99,0:11:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,O que eu faço?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:14.19,0:11:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Que tal anunciar que está recrutando no quadro de recados de uma casa de shows?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:17.99,0:11:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hã?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:18.52,0:11:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Tem um lugar chamado CiRCLe aqui perto.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:20.49,0:11:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Abriram uma filial recentemente em Ikebukuro.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:23.29,0:11:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Se chama RiNG.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:24.90,0:11:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Mesmo? Acho que vou dar uma passada lá.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:28.34,0:11:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Embora eu não pretenda levar tão a sério assim...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:36.14,0:11:39.09,Flashback,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&\t(0,139,1,\3c&H323232&\4c&H000000&)\t(2725,0,1,\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}Acho que a Tomori-chan não toca em nenhuma banda. {copiado}
Dialogue: 50,0:11:40.61,0:11:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Vou perguntar só pra garantir.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:45.39,0:11:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ué? Aonde ela foi?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:53.61,0:11:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Te achei.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:55.13,0:11:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,É... Takamatsu-san...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:00.03,0:12:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Doeu...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:01.62,0:12:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Tropeçou!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:02.99,0:12:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, não se preocupe.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:06.59,0:12:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai, ai, ai...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:08.03,0:12:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Band-aid{\i0}.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:09.72,0:12:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hã?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:11.30,0:12:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Ei!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:13.02,0:12:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Espera, isso é lixo?!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:16.70,0:12:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Ei! Takamatsu-san?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:20.57,0:12:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Ei! Já joguei o lixo fora.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:28.78,0:12:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Takamatsu-san?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:32.43,0:12:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Qual prefere?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:33.75,0:12:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hã? Incrível!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:36.01,0:12:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,É tudo {\i1}band-aid{\i0}?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:37.74,0:12:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,É.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:38.54,0:12:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Tudo bem eu usar?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:39.78,0:12:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:41.00,0:12:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Mesmo? Desculpe.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:42.89,0:12:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, eu gosto de pinguins.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:44.45,0:12:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,É um pinguim-de-barbicha.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:45.62,0:12:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Barbicha?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:46.49,0:12:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Tem uma barbicha no rosto dele, viu?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:48.18,0:12:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,É do mesmo gênero que o pinguim-de-adélia e o pinguim-gentoo.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:51.30,0:12:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, esse é o pinguim-de-adélia.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:53.75,0:12:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Tem outros da série de pinguins.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:55.68,0:12:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Espera um pouco...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:57.83,0:12:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Tem vários animais...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:58.32,0:13:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Você gosta de pinguins?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:00.52,0:13:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hã?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:02.34,0:13:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu acho... eles fofos.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:06.39,0:13:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que essa falta de confiança?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:08.18,0:13:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu só coleciono mesmo.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:10.55,0:13:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Acho que o que eu gosto é procurá-los... talvez.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:14.73,0:13:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, mas eu te entendo.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:16.53,0:13:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu também compraria se encontrasse pinguins fofos assim.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:19.07,0:13:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Mesmo?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:20.72,0:13:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Tenho o pinguim-africano e o pinguim-macaroni.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:23.21,0:13:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,E o pinguim-rei também!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:24.51,0:13:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Calma! Não preciso de tantos.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:29.95,0:13:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Tá, eu fico com eles.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:39.05,0:13:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Essas...
Dialogue: 50,0:13:40.55,0:13:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Parece que a antiga presidente do clube gostava delas.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:46.38,0:13:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,"12 de dezembro, poeira encontrada! \NSeu formato parece a Nebulosa do Caranguejo!"
Dialogue: 50,0:13:54.12,0:13:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Essa é de uma senpai anterior a anterior da anterior.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:57.17,0:13:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,A que veio antes de mim foi a última.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:00.85,0:14:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,"Hoje vi as estrelas! La, la, la{\fnArial Unicode MS}♪{\r} Um céu estrelado! {se for fazer, se vira}
Dialogue: 50,0:14:05.07,0:14:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,"La, la, la"?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:06.57,0:14:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Que tipo de estrela deve ter sido?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:11.23,0:14:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,O clube de astronomia parece atrair bastante gente excêntrica.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:13.88,0:14:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Ou melhor dizendo... únicas.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:16.37,0:14:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Quer se juntar?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:17.11,0:14:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hã?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:18.09,0:14:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Só tem eu aqui.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:21.03,0:14:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Não vai ser encerrado se eu me esforçar para produzir relatórios sobre as atividades.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:24.43,0:14:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas eu ficaria muito feliz se entrasse para o clube!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:27.59,0:14:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Claro! Vou pensar a respeito.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:31.98,0:14:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ficou deprimida de novo.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:35.98,0:14:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Esse clima não me agrada.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:38.75,0:14:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mas...
Dialogue: 50,0:14:41.24,0:14:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, esse caderno...
Dialogue: 50,0:14:44.31,0:14:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Que saudade!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:45.98,0:14:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu também usava ele no primário.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:49.55,0:14:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso... {se for fazer, se vira}
Dialogue: 50,0:14:50.99,0:14:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Está numa banda!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:52.89,0:14:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,As garotas disseram que você não estava em nenhuma.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:57.05,0:14:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,“Haruhikage”... Nunca ouvi falar...
Dialogue: 50,0:15:04.63,0:15:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Não estou mais na banda.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:07.49,0:15:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Sério?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:08.43,0:15:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Então, não quer formar uma comigo?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:09.71,0:15:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hã?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:10.09,0:15:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu toco guitarra e canto; fora isso,\N pode escolher o que quiser.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:13.99,0:15:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Vou atrair a atenção de todas se eu apanhar a mascote da turma.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:19.77,0:15:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Não quero.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:22.70,0:15:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Mesmo? Bom, tudo bem.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:27.84,0:15:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Mesmo que forme uma banda...
Dialogue: 50,0:15:33.41,0:15:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,vai acabar igual.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:39.93,0:15:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, poxa!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:41.76,0:15:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos sair para nos divertirmos, Tomori-chan!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:43.96,0:15:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hã?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:44.80,0:15:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Horas assim pedem um karaokê! Vamos!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:46.89,0:15:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hã? Quê?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:56.27,0:15:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Tenham um bom dia.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:07.65,0:16:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Mutsumi-chan!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:09.59,0:16:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Desculpe.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:10.55,0:16:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu precisava vê-la antes das atividades do clube começarem.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:13.33,0:16:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Não quer sentar?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:17.31,0:16:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,A Saki-chan entrou em contato?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:21.36,0:16:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Mesmo?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:22.95,0:16:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Diferente de mim, por serem amigas de infância,
Dialogue: 50,0:16:26.53,0:16:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,imaginei que ela fosse ligar.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:34.55,0:16:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Onde será que a Saki-chan está agora?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:37.81,0:16:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Acha que ela está se saindo bem?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:46.62,0:16:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Naquela hora, quando a Saki-chan disse que iria sair da banda...
Dialogue: 50,0:16:51.30,0:16:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu deveria ter dado ouvidos às circunstâncias dela.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:59.08,0:17:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Sinto muito, Mutsumi-chan!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:01.50,0:17:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Não é sua culpa.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:04.96,0:17:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Vou me encontrar com a Taki-chan depois do clube.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:08.09,0:17:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Não quer me acompanhar?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:10.65,0:17:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hoje é dia do balé.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:12.30,0:17:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,É mesmo. Precisa praticar.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:16.02,0:17:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Não se preocupe.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:17.33,0:17:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,As coisas vão voltar a ser como eram.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:21.30,0:17:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Deixe tudo comigo.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:30.55,0:17:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Taki-chan!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:32.63,0:17:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Melhorou muito passando café.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:35.30,0:17:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Nem tanto.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:36.12,0:17:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Ajuda muito você aprender rápido.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:38.65,0:17:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Não quer tentar atender agora?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:40.51,0:17:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Interagir com pessoas é meio...
Dialogue: 50,0:17:42.29,0:17:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Hã? Mas você interage comigo.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:45.55,0:17:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Ei!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:46.95,0:17:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Poxa! Vou colocá-la para\N atender na próxima, ouviu?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:49.33,0:17:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Ririko-san!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:52.24,0:17:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu já venho.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:53.76,0:17:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Kasumi-chan, tudo certo?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:56.00,0:17:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Nada certo.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:59.92,0:18:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Estamos em duas...
Dialogue: 50,0:18:02.71,0:18:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,O cupom também vale?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:04.11,0:18:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Claro.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:04.69,0:18:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Então...
Dialogue: 50,0:18:09.08,0:18:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,O que foi?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:10.26,0:18:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Nada.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:11.12,0:18:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Por acaso é sua primeira vez em um karaokê?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:15.90,0:18:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Já estive aqui antes.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:18.55,0:18:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Quer cantar sumimi? {não inventa}
Dialogue: 50,0:18:20.29,0:18:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu canto a parte da Uika e você a da Mana.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:24.03,0:18:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Quem são essas?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:24.79,0:18:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hã? Não conhece a sumimi?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:26.58,0:18:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Olá!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:27.55,0:18:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Somos a sumimi!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:28.48,0:18:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,São elas!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:29.67,0:18:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\org(1111.79,573.75)\pos(916.05,84.36)\fax0.000001\fscx105\fscy115.42\frz0.9443\frx0.4157\fry-0.7384\xbord3.52\ybord4.16\xshad1.46\yshad1.73\fs70}Como estão?\N A Mana está ótima!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:33.75,0:18:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\org(1111.79,573.75)\pos(916.05,84.36)\fax0.000001\fscx105\fscy115.42\frz0.9443\frx0.4157\fry-0.7384\xbord3.52\ybord4.16\xshad1.46\yshad1.73\fs70}Esperamos que as músicas da sumimi os deixem ainda melhores!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:36.89,0:18:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\org(1111.79,573.75)\pos(916.05,84.36)\fax0.000001\fscx105\fscy115.42\frz0.9443\frx0.4157\fry-0.7384\xbord3.52\ybord4.16\xshad1.46\yshad1.73\fs70}Isso aí!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:37.88,0:18:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\org(1111.79,573.75)\pos(916.05,84.36)\fax0.000001\fscx105\fscy115.42\frz0.9443\frx0.4157\fry-0.7384\xbord3.52\ybord4.16\xshad1.46\yshad1.73\fs70}Cantem com a gente!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:40.18,0:18:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Não são fofas?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:44.22,0:18:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... melhor cantar algo que goste.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:46.94,0:18:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Não vou cantar.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:47.84,0:18:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hã?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:48.49,0:18:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Cantar não é o meu forte.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:50.62,0:18:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Não tem problema.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:52.43,0:18:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Viemos juntas, afinal.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:53.97,0:18:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Não é legal se só eu cantar.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:59.01,0:19:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Qual era mesmo o nome?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:01.36,0:19:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Haruhikage{\i0}...
Dialogue: 50,0:19:04.63,0:19:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Não aparece nada.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:05.92,0:19:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,É a música que fizemos juntas.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:09.48,0:19:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,“Vai acabar igual” ao quê?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:11.51,0:19:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hã?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:12.42,0:19:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Aquilo que disse antes.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:14.09,0:19:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que acha que vai acabar igual se formar uma banda?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:17.21,0:19:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Sua banda brigava muito?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:20.75,0:19:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Não me diga que foi aquilo?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:21.87,0:19:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Diferenças musicais?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:23.48,0:19:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Não... acho.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:25.94,0:19:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Não é?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:30.18,0:19:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Acho que... foi minha culpa.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:33.84,0:19:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,É mesmo? Que dureza.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:39.96,0:19:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas sempre pode se esforçar mais para que não aconteça de novo.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:45.75,0:19:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Quando as coisas dão errado,\N se não acreditar que pode recomeçar...
Dialogue: 50,0:19:50.97,0:19:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,A vida é longa, sabe? Precisa tentar.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:53.98,0:19:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Pode ser que tenha um encontro predestinado com membros incríveis...
Dialogue: 50,0:19:59.15,0:20:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Não estou dizendo que essa sou eu,
Dialogue: 50,0:20:01.56,0:20:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,mas eu gostaria de formar uma banda.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:03.77,0:20:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Me entende?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:07.57,0:20:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Então...
Dialogue: 50,0:20:11.01,0:20:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Seremos uma banda para toda vida?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:21.46,0:20:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Toda vida?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:27.32,0:20:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomori-chan?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:34.53,0:20:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomori-chan, espera!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:40.85,0:20:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Desculpa por rir.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:44.89,0:20:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Tudo bem.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:46.35,0:20:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Fui eu quem disse uma coisa estranha.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:50.68,0:20:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Obrigada por me convidar para a sua banda.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:54.86,0:20:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas... sinto muito.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:57.84,0:20:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomori-chan.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:02.14,0:21:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomori!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:05.60,0:21:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomori, tudo bem?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:07.44,0:21:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Quem é você? O que quer?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:09.62,0:21:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Quer o quê?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:10.93,0:21:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Conhece ela, Tomori-chan?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:12.47,0:21:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sou eu quem faz as perguntas.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:17.40,0:21:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomori!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:18.26,0:21:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Espera!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:18.78,0:21:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Ei!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:20.71,0:21:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomori!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:23.03,0:21:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Tá achando que é quem?!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:25.01,0:21:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Amiga dela, já disse.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:26.77,0:21:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Amiga?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:27.68,0:21:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Somos amigas! Algum problema?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:30.37,0:21:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Estava correndo atrás dela, não estava?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:32.50,0:21:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Corri atrás dela porque ela fugiu.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:34.51,0:21:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu só a convidei para formar uma banda.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:37.16,0:21:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hã?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:38.79,0:21:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Convidou a Tomori para a sua banda?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:41.91,0:21:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,É, convidei. E daí?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:44.48,0:21:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Escuta, esse seu jeito de falar...
Dialogue: 50,0:21:47.09,0:21:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Você é horrível.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:48.41,0:21:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Quê?
